# Supabase — Backend & Data Access

## Client

- Typed client: `getSupabase()` from `lib/supabase/client.ts` returns `SupabaseClient<Database> | null`
- Types: `lib/supabase/database.types.ts` — regenerate with `npm run types:supabase`
- Never expose service role key in client code — anon key only; RLS enforces access
- Mock mode: when env vars missing, `getSupabase()` returns `null` — services must handle mock path

## Import style (client & auth)

- **Static import only** for `@/lib/supabase/client` and `@/lib/supabase/auth` — top-level `import { getSupabase }` / `import { getAuthService }`.
- Do **not** use `import('@/lib/supabase/client')` or `import('@/lib/supabase/auth')` in services/components that already load these modules via the main bundle (ESLint `no-restricted-syntax`).

## Data access layer

- **No Supabase queries in React components** — use `features/*/services/*.ts` or shared repos under `lib/supabase/`
- Application code: `camelCase`; database columns/tables: `snake_case`
- Always handle errors: `if (error) throw ...` or use `lib/supabase/errors.ts` helpers
- Select specific columns — avoid `*` on large tables
- Pagination: `.range(from, to)` or explicit limit/offset; never unbounded lists in production UI

## Auth

- Use Supabase Auth — do not build custom auth
- Client session check: `getSession()` (local storage, not verified server-side)
- Verified user: `getUser()` (validates JWT with Supabase)
- Auth helpers: `lib/supabase/auth.ts`
- PKCE flow already configured in client — preserve `flowType: 'pkce'`

## Row-Level Security (RLS)

- **Enable RLS on every table** — no exceptions for production
- Policies for SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE as needed
- Use `auth.uid()` in policies for user-scoped data
- Service role bypasses RLS — server/edge only
- Test policies with different roles when adding tables

## Migrations

- All schema changes via Supabase CLI: `supabase migration new <name>`
- Never edit applied production migrations — create new migration
- Include RLS policies in migrations, not ad-hoc SQL
- Local test: `supabase db reset`

## Edge Functions

- TypeScript on Deno under `supabase/functions/`
- Validate input at function entry
- Use service role inside edge functions for admin operations only
- Return consistent JSON + appropriate HTTP status codes

## Realtime & Storage

- Unsubscribe channels on unmount
- **UI images (avatar, logo, gallery):** prefer **Cloudinary** via `lib/media/` — CDN transforms, public HTTPS URLs. See `docs/UI-CONVENTIONS.md` § Media upload.
- **Supabase Storage:** use for private files / documents if needed later; organize by entity (`avatars/{user_id}/...`); validate file type/size client and server
- Signed URLs for private files; public URLs only for public assets

## Query integration

- TanStack Query wraps service calls in hooks — see `02-state-data.mdc`
- Shared stale/gc times: `lib/supabase/query-config.ts`

## Egress optimization (PostgREST)

Checklist nội bộ: `docs/supabase-egress.md`. Bắt buộc khi thêm bảng/module mới:

- **`features/<entity>/core/supabase-select.ts`**: khai báo `*_SELECT_TABLE` (list), `*_SELECT_FULL` (detail/form), `*_SELECT_STATS` (tab thống kê — cột tối thiểu), `*_RETURNING_*` (mutation tối thiểu)
- **`features/<entity>/core/map-from-db.ts`**: mapper inbound DB row → domain type; FK `bigint` luôn `string` trong app layer (tham chiếu `features/he-thong/thong-tin-cong-ty/core/cong-ty-map.ts`)
- **`createRepository`**: truyền `select` + `mapFromDb: mapXFromDb` — mọi `getPage` / `getById` / mutation trả domain đã coerce
- **Query Supabase trực tiếp** (ngoài repo): gọi `mapXFromDb`; outbound insert/filter bigint → number chỉ tại boundary (vd. `chucVuIdToDb`)
- **Mutations**: truyền `returningSelect` tối thiểu qua `RepositoryMutationOptions` — không `returning *` trên bảng lớn
- **List UI**: pagination (`.range` / `getPage`); tránh `getAll()` không giới hạn trên bảng transaction
- **Master data**: `getAll()` chỉ khi dự kiến nhỏ; mutation ưu tiên `getById` / count head-only thay refetch full table
- **Count**: query `head: true` tách biệt khỏi list khi có phân trang server
- **Cache**: TanStack Query `listQueryOptions` / `masterDataQueryOptions` / `authSensitiveQueryOptions` (quyền session); patch cache trước khi invalidate
- **Stats tab (≤500 rows)**: client aggregate + `*_SELECT_STATS`; khi scale lớn → SQL view read-model hoặc RPC aggregate
- **Realtime**: subscribe tối thiểu; `unsubscribe` on unmount
- **Ảnh UI**: Cloudinary qua `lib/media/` — không Supabase Storage cho avatar/logo công khai

## Security checklist

- Parameterized queries via Supabase client (never concatenate user input into SQL)
- Audit new columns for RLS policy updates
- Rate-limit public edge functions
